{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>A discharge in her flesh.</b> The letter bet in place of mem, meaning: her discharge from her flesh. And 'her flesh' is a euphemism for the genital region. <b>Seven days she shall be in her nidah.</b> The entire seven she shall be in her nidah — this teaches that she does not immerse before daybreak."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:12:32.598942064Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}